            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.6.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[NoManos 2.6.4

- Task diff view: inspect file diffs across tasks with prompt lineage and request links.
- Usage-limit recovery: automatic recovery and resumption for tasks stopped by usage limits.
- Speech recognition recovery: deadline monitoring and reliable recovery after recognition stalls.
- Stop button isolation: stopping a transcript prompt or thinking generation no longer cancels running background tasks.
- Device volume policy: coordinated volume handling and improved voice processing demand control.
]]></description>
